xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-596-ten selected equations, giving a provisional raw hybrid size of 128
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-597-variables/133 rows. The actual cap and size come from the x-side manifest.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md:598:D45 tests whether the new rows kill the chosen D43 branch or create a
