xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-600-level 48 and first appears at D49.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-601-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-602-## 5. Flat branch: the exact D75 germ-certification plan
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-603-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-604-“Flat” must mean more than seeing 37 again in a finite matrix. At one proposed
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-605-live completion $s$, the branch must prove both
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-606-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-607-\[
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-608- \ell(L_s^+)\ge37\quad\text{and}\quad
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-609- F^{n+37}Y^+\subseteq L_s^+(F^nX)\quad(n\ge0).              \tag{5.1}
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-610-\]
--
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-741-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-742-Conditional on `CYCLIC-30`/the surplus bridge,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-743-**CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30**, **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION** (or a comparably
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-744-small explicit R2 scheme), and no new surplus directions, the finite answer is
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-745-plausibly yes. The provisional $344\times340$ matrix has 116,960 dense slots,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-746-so modular elimination and dual-witness extraction are a seconds-to-minutes
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-747-task. The nonlinear prolongation has only 25 new affine frontiers if the
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-748-post-41 first-occurrence structure persists. The existing D25 certificate
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-749-demonstrates that a reversible pivot DAG can be tiny even when a monolithic
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-750-Gröbner presentation is not.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-751-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-752-> **CONJECTURE (engineering estimate).** After a correct x-side model exists,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md:753:> a one-cell D43 compiler is hours-scale, and a one-representative pointwise
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-754-> D75 prolongation is hours to a few days, with a certificate measured in tens
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-755-> of megabytes rather than an expanded all-family Gröbner object. Rank-chart
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-756-> proliferation is the principal variance. A naively expanded 36-fiber D75
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-757-> compiler should not be attempted first.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-758-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-759-This estimate covers a finite point and its finite derivative. The pivot
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-760-method does not automatically produce `CYCLIC-30`, `BRIDGE-30`, `FILTER-30`,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-761-or the all-depth Ore section. Those are research theorems, and `PARAM-30` may
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-762-be harder than reaching D75 geometrically. The immediate blocker is the
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-763-unimplemented x-side, not matrix size.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-764-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-765-## 6. Growth branch and the exact boundary of a kill theorem
--
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-976-$\mathcal H(z)=0$ also give $\mathcal H(s_D)\in F^DY^+$. Lemma 6.3 then
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-977-retains loss at most $e$; for $D\ge2e+1$, the universal application gates give
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-978-the abstract Newton hypotheses at $s_D$. This still starts from the unknown
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-979-root's abstract section; a finite artifact additionally needs
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-980-**CONJECTURE EFFECTIVE-PARAM-30**, and discovery from finite data needs
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-981-**CONJECTURE EFFECTIVE-SEARCH-30**. If the compiler proves only
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-982-$s_D-z\in F^qX$, it also needs $q\ge D$ and the corresponding
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-983-filtration-Lipschitz residual estimate. Until these statements are proved,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-984-only the exact-root-completion argument above is rigorous.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-985-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-986-## 7. Campaign decision rule
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-987-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md:988:The next action is not another run of the band-40 scanner. It is the D43
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-989-compiler of §4.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-990-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md:991:1. If $H_{29}u^1$ has a dual cokernel witness at a compatible D43 survivor,
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-992-   the floor grows pointwise to at least 43. Repeat at D49 to test
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-993-   $H_{29}u^2$, and seek an all-index Ore/cokernel recurrence before making
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-994-   a growth theorem.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-995-2. If $H_{29}u^1$ is covered and no other new target is missed, record only
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-996-   “flat through level 42.” Pursue the all-depth loss-37 section and the D75
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-997-   point in parallel; neither finite observation proves exact flatness.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md:998:3. If the scoped D43 scheme is exhaustively EMPTY, bank the finite-depth kill
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-999-   and stop the loss campaign for that scope.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1000-4. If a cofinal growing floor is eventually proved, report Theorem 6.1
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1001-   unconditionally and Theorem 6.2 only with
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1002-   **CONJECTURE FORMAL-REGULARITY-30** visibly attached.
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1003-
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1004-The decisive distinction is therefore not “37 at D23 versus 37 at D25.” It
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1005-is whether the corrected post-41 operator supplies a preimage or a new dual
xmodel/sol-h29-dichotomy.md-1006-cokernel witness for $t^{42}e_{29}$, with the real x-side present.
