xmodel/sol-xside.log-15616-+represent their tangent directions as a sparse x-side column sidecar.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15617-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15618-+**CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION.** The pending LR2/R2 x-side model derives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15619-+the values and tangent maps of (2.3), with all its h-Newton budget equations,
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15620-+from legal polynomial/source data. LR2 proves the single-cluster geometry;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15621-+it does not supply these coefficients or their Jacobian. `SHEET6-R1.md`
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15622-+section 16.5 explicitly records this model as future work.
