xmodel/sol-xside.log-15658-+| independent \(D\alpha_m\) or \(D\beta_m\) | \(42m\) | \(42m\) | \(42m\) |
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15659-+| product \(\alpha_i\beta_j\) | \(42(i+j)\) | \(42(i+j)\) | later by convolution |
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15660-+
