xmodel/sol-xside.log-15663-+- only \(\alpha,\beta\) can affect the residual value;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15664-+- if \(\alpha,\beta\) are held fixed, their multiplication of a registered
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15665-+  y-tail variation starts at \(42+6=48\), so it does not alter the
xmodel/sol-xside.log-15666-+  30-tail derivative through row 42;
