xmodel/sol-xside.log:75436:+### 2.1 Exact normalized factor streams
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75437-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75438-+For a genuine polynomial pair, take the y-leading polynomials
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75439-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75440-+\[
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75441-+\begin{aligned}
xmodel/sol-xside.log-75442-+ \phi_f(x)&=[y^{126}](f-a)
