xmodel/sol-xside.log-76372-+- **CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30:** universal two-sided pristine/emitted bridge;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76373-+- **CONJECTURE FILTER-30:** the full source-dependent normalization is
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76374-+  filtered and has no hidden negative shift;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76375-+- **CONJECTURE PARAM-30:** an all-depth causal right section exists with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76376-+  finite stated loss;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76377-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:76378:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76379-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76380-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76381-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76382-+  survives Row 42;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-76383-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-GRADING:** the finite grading/surplus pattern survives
