xmodel/sol-xside.log-77112-+levels 53 and 55, but the named old e-plus evaluator does not solve or store
xmodel/sol-xside.log-77113-+their values: its zero-completion rule and `vals.get(r,0)` supply zero.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-77114-+They are therefore banked coordinate slots/labels, not banked nonzero
xmodel/sol-xside.log-77115-+completion values or retained coordinates of the reduced D25 cell.
