xmodel/sol-xside.log-79108-+   columns in the order printed above;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79109-+3. any proved independent x-side columns after those, ordered by
xmodel/sol-xside.log:79110:+   `(factor, m)`.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79111-+
