xmodel/sol-xside.log-79113-+inside the old lists. An internal implementation may use that order, but it
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79114-+must project and reorder by stable labels before hashing. A naïve top-left
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79115-+slice is not an acceptable legacy gate unless the append-only serialization
