xmodel/sol-xside.log-79670-+  filtered and has no hidden negative shift;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79671-+- **CONJECTURE PARAM-30:** an all-depth causal right section exists with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79672-+  finite stated loss;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79673-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:79674:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79675-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79676-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79677-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79678-+  survives Row 42;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79679-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-GRADING:** the finite grading/surplus pattern survives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79680-+  the first x-side row;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79681-+- **CONJECTURE X-CUBE-RELATION:** \(U_g^2=U_f^3\) at the required pristine
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79682-+  source tier.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79683-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log:79684:+A finite D43 matrix can still certify a pointwise lower bound without proving
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79685-+the all-depth conjectures, provided its finite source/output census,
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79686-+completion, full formula, and causality are exact. It cannot certify a
