xmodel/sol-xside.log-79765-+### 1.1 The banked 30 y-tail input streams
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79766-+
--
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79781-+| 25--27 | `tg01` | \(0,2,4\) |
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79782-+| 28--30 | `tg02` | \(0,2,4\) |
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79783-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79784-+Their shifts are
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79785-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79786-+\[
