xmodel/sol-xside.log-79792-+coefficient of **absolute** level \(32+10=42\). It is not the normalized
xmodel/sol-xside.log:79793:+x-factor correction at **operator** level 42.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79794-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79795-+A coordinate `(family,r)` has global source level \(r\), absolute root-tail
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79796-+level \(32+r\), and belongs to the unique residue stream
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79797-+\(\rho\equiv r\pmod6\). In stream coordinates its \(j\)-th coefficient has
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79798-+level \(r_\rho+6j\).
