xmodel/sol-xside.log-79819-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79820-+**CONJECTURE CYCLIC-30.** These are all output streams at every depth.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79821-+Only the finite pure-y grading through band 41 is banked. At row 42 the
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79822-+compiler must retain and audit every pristine eta component with \(a\ge30\).
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79823-+The slot-aware degree bound used by the present construction is
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79824-+\(\deg_\eta\Phi_y\le14\), \(\deg_\eta\Gamma_y\le20\) through \(t^{42}\),
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79825-+so the possible surplus is eta 30--33; that bound itself must be established
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79826-+before truncation. A new independent component enlarges the target; it may
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79827-+not be discarded because it misses the 30-stream selector.
