xmodel/sol-xside.log-79860-+\[
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79861-+  (\alpha_1,\ldots,\alpha_{42}),\qquad
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79862-+  (\beta_1,\ldots,\beta_{63}),                              \tag{2.3}
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79863-+\]
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79864-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log:79865:+with factor-coordinate levels \(42m\). If
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79866-+\(\phi_f=c_f\prod_i(x-\xi_i)\) and
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79867-+\(\phi_g=c_g\prod_j(x-\zeta_j)\), then
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79868-+\(\alpha_1=-\sum_i\xi_i\) and \(\beta_1=-\sum_j\zeta_j\).
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79869-+
