xmodel/sol-xside.log-79874-+       U_f=1+\alpha t^{42}+O(t^{84}),\quad
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79875-+       U_g=1+\beta t^{42}+O(t^{84}).                        \tag{2.4}
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79876-+\]
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79877-+
