xmodel/sol-xside.log-79924-+| product \(\alpha_i\beta_j\) | \(42(i+j)\) | \(42(i+j)\) | later by convolution |
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79925-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-79926-+Consequences for the band-42 window:
