xmodel/sol-xside.log-80092-+\end{aligned}}                                             \tag{3.9}
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80093-+\]
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80094-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80095-+There is no honest numerical specialization of (3.9) in the current
