xmodel/sol-xside.log-80198-+Equation (4.2) is conditional. Independent \(\alpha,\beta\) give
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80199-+\(184\times182\); a proved one-coordinate x quotient gives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80200-+\(184\times181\); any surplus output adds rows.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80201-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80202-+For artifact stability, define the canonical serialized order to be:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80203-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-80204-+1. the exact old ordered row registry, followed by the ten new rows in the
