xmodel/sol-xside.log-81310-+### 2.2 Mandatory tangent classification
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81311-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81312-+At a named completion, each consumed x coefficient must be classified as
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81313-+exactly one of:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81314-+
