xmodel/sol-xside.log-81324-+cannot be quotiented away from a single-window kernel observation. A proved
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81325-+source quotient which retains only that combination would instead give
xmodel/sol-xside.log-81326-+\(184\times181\).
