xmodel/sol-xside.log-82188-+- **CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30:** universal two-sided pristine/emitted bridge;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82189-+- **CONJECTURE FILTER-30:** the full source-dependent normalization is
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82190-+  filtered and has no hidden negative shift;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82191-+- **CONJECTURE PARAM-30:** an all-depth causal right section exists with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82192-+  finite stated loss;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82193-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:82194:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82195-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82196-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82197-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82198-+  survives Row 42;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82199-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-GRADING:** the finite grading/surplus pattern survives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82200-+  the first x-side row;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82201-+- **CONJECTURE X-CUBE-RELATION:** \(U_g^2=U_f^3\) at the required pristine
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82202-+  source tier.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82203-+
