xmodel/sol-xside.log-82454-+       U_f=1+\alpha t^{42}+O(t^{84}),\quad
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82455-+       U_g=1+\beta t^{42}+O(t^{84}).                        \tag{2.4}
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82456-+\]
