xmodel/sol-xside.log-82469-+### 2.2 Mandatory tangent classification
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82470-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82471-+At a named completion, each consumed x coefficient must be classified as
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82472-+exactly one of:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-82473-+
