xmodel/sol-xside.log-83347-+- **CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30:** universal two-sided pristine/emitted bridge;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83348-+- **CONJECTURE FILTER-30:** the full source-dependent normalization is
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83349-+  filtered and has no hidden negative shift;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83350-+- **CONJECTURE PARAM-30:** an all-depth causal right section exists with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83351-+  finite stated loss;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83352-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:83353:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83354-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83355-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83356-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83357-+  survives Row 42;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83358-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-GRADING:** the finite grading/surplus pattern survives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83359-+  the first x-side row;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83360-+- **CONJECTURE X-CUBE-RELATION:** \(U_g^2=U_f^3\) at the required pristine
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83361-+  source tier.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83362-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log:83363:+A finite D43 matrix can still certify a pointwise lower bound without proving
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83364-+the all-depth conjectures, provided its finite source/output census,
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83365-+completion, full formula, and causality are exact. It cannot certify a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83366-+30-by-30 index or section if **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30** fails.
