xmodel/sol-xside.log-83569-+### 2.2 Mandatory tangent classification
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83570-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83571-+At a named completion, each consumed x coefficient must be classified as
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83572-+exactly one of:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83573-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83574-+1. **held fixed:** its value is part of the completion and its differential
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83575-+   is excluded from the declared Newton source for a proved reason;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83576-+2. **derived:** it is an explicit function of the 30 y-tail streams, and the
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83577-+   exact chain-rule row \(D\alpha,D\beta\) is supplied;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83578-+3. **independent:** it is a genuine filtered tangent coordinate.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83579-+
