xmodel/sol-xside.log-83581-+additional level-42 columns and shape \(184\times182\). Row 42 sees only one
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83582-+linear combination of them, but the other direction may engage later; it
xmodel/sol-xside.log-83583-+cannot be quotiented away from a single-window kernel observation. A proved
