xmodel/sol-xside.log-84452-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:84453:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-84454-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-84455-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-84456-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
