xmodel/sol-xside.log-85579-+15. **LOSS-BRUTE/FAST.** Require agreement of the literal and optimized
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85580-+    scans in section 7, including \(n=0\), maximizing target labels, and
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85581-+    exact dual witnesses.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85582-+16. **CROSS-PRIME.** Run first at 105337 and replay at 105673 with
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85583-+    identical registries, symbolic incidence/character patterns, and
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85584-+    verdict semantics. Equality of evaluated nonzero support is diagnostic
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85585-+    only unless a common-lift theorem rules out prime-specific modular
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85586-+    cancellation.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85587-+17. **GENERAL NEGATIVE CONTROLS.** Perturb a source point coordinate with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85588-+    recorded incidence, a matrix entry hit by a stored dual witness, one
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85589-+    registry label/order entry, and one deliberately omitted manifest
