xmodel/sol-xside.log-85596-+## 10. Conjecture and stop ledger
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85597-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85598-+The following statements are not proved by this specification:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85599-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85600-+- **CONJECTURE CYCLIC-30:** no additional all-depth output stream;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85601-+- **CONJECTURE BRIDGE-30:** universal two-sided pristine/emitted bridge;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85602-+- **CONJECTURE FILTER-30:** the full source-dependent normalization is
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85603-+  filtered and has no hidden negative shift;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85604-+- **CONJECTURE PARAM-30:** an all-depth causal right section exists with a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85605-+  finite stated loss;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85606-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-DERIVATION:** legal LR2/R2 data determine all consumed
xmodel/sol-xside.log:85607:+  x-factor values and tangent maps;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85608-+- **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30:** those data add no independent source/output to
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85609-+  the 30-by-30 corrected operator;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85610-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-FIRST-OCCURRENCE:** the ten-variable frontier law
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85611-+  survives Row 42;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85612-+- **CONJECTURE POST41-GRADING:** the finite grading/surplus pattern survives
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85613-+  the first x-side row;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85614-+- **CONJECTURE X-CUBE-RELATION:** \(U_g^2=U_f^3\) at the required pristine
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85615-+  source tier.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85616-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log:85617:+A finite D43 matrix can still certify a pointwise lower bound without proving
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85618-+the all-depth conjectures, provided its finite source/output census,
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85619-+completion, full formula, and causality are exact. It cannot certify a
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85620-+30-by-30 index or section if **CONJECTURE X-SIDE-30** fails.
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85621-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85622-+The implementation must stop and rederive its source/target model upon any of:
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85623-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85624-+- an unclassified \(\alpha,\beta\) tangent;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85625-+- a nonzero independent eta-surplus row;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85626-+- a source coordinate absent from the consumption manifest;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85627-+- a causality violation;
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85628-+- a normalized-prefix-causality failure followed by any claim of
xmodel/sol-xside.log-85629-+  \(M^+(N)\) or \(\delta^+(N)\);
