xmodel/sol-xside.log-86322-+### 5.3 Three separately named run modes
xmodel/sol-xside.log-86323-+
xmodel/sol-xside.log-86324-+1. **`LEGACY_BAND40_REGRESSION`.** Use each named old completion and require
