+
+The first four, dormant-55 columns form
+
+\[
+ A_{28}^{(55)}=[v_1\ v_2\ v_1\ v_2]
+                  \operatorname{diag}(d_1,d_2,d_3,d_4),
+ \qquad \operatorname{rank}A_{28}^{(55)}=2.                \tag{3.2}
