+\[
+ C_{28}=
+ [\,v_1\ v_2\ v_1\ v_2\ w_1\ w_2\ w_1\ w_2\ w_1\ w_2\,].       \tag{3.1}
+\]
+
+The four displayed vectors, in row order
+\(h=1,4,\ldots,28\), are as follows.
+
+| \(h\) | \(v_1\) | \(v_2\) | \(w_1\) | \(w_2\) |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| **\(p=105337\)** ||||
